        "published_at": "2026-10-02T08:28:11Z",
        "notes": "GolfHub Perth 0.1.19\r\n\r\n- See when your selected date is due to open for booking on each course's tee-time card, using Perth time.\r\n- Published opening schedules are included for 12 courses. Hamersley's conflicting guidance is clearly marked as an estimate; other unconfirmed schedules say so rather than guessing a date.\r\n- Course information distinguishes online release schedules from contact or walk-in arrangements across all 41 courses.\r\n- Opening notices handle each selected date separately, preserve published availability, and prompt a fresh check when saved results predate the opening.\r\n- Removed the separate \"Plan your next round\" section from Home.\r\n\r\nBooking windows do not guarantee available spots. Course schedules can change.\r\n",
