        "published_at": "2026-09-25T19:20:44Z",
        "notes": "GolfHub Perth 5.1.17\r\n\r\nUpdate verification release.\r\n\r\nThis release has the same functionality as 5.1.16 with a higher version number so users can test the automatic download, installation and restart process.\r\n\r\nIt retains faster cached tee-time loading and the improved GitHub download compatibility introduced in 5.1.16.\r\n\r\nTo test, start from 5.1.16 and use Updates > Check now > Update now, or enable both automatic-update options and leave GolfHub idle with booking windows closed. After restarting, Updates should show 5.1.17.\r\n\r\nIf the update fails, use Open update log and share the error details. A successful update on the previously affected laptop is still to be confirmed.\r\n",
